<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose by 2.50 basis points to 25.50 percent on Tuesday, from 25.475 percent on Monday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised each working day.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
